Hello guardians! The game has had several updates in the past few days, and the current version is 1.0.15. Please check your version number before playing!

We sincerely apologize for an issue caused by an update around 3:40 a.m. (PDT) on October 9th, which resulted in the disappearance of raw materials and outputs in factories. We have already issued an emergency fix. If you updated at that time on October 9th and encountered issues with your city operations, your previous save files are still usable. We deeply apologize for any inconvenience this has caused to your gaming experience!

In version 1.0.15, we have made significant optimizations to frame rate performance. The lag caused by a large number of NPCs and monsters in the mid-to-late game has been greatly reduced. We've also optimized memory usage to some extent, and the game now takes up about 6GB of memory in the default startup mode.
Several other optimizations have been made in previous versions. Please check the changes below:
Version 1.0.15 (2024.10.9)

Added an "Aggressive Network Optimization" setting. In some cases, enabling this can improve network performance. The host can choose to stop waiting for high-latency players;
Fixed recurring errors in certain save files;
Optimized game performance;
Fixed white and black line issues in some frame sequences;
Added ultra-low resolution assets;
Fixed missing title image assets in some languages.
Versions 1.0.13~1.0.14 (2024.10.8)

Added an option to enter the tutorial when starting the game for the first time;
Fixed an issue where the logistics center would lose materials.
Version 1.0.12 (2024.10.7)

Door open/close states can now be saved correctly;
Fixed an issue where some monsters couldn't be killed;
Fixed animation playback issues for guest players.
Version 1.0.11 (2024.10.7)

Fixed incorrect building sizes on the map;
Fixed an issue where the third player could not join during multiplayer;
Fixed errors when demolishing soldier housing;
Fixed flickering issues with workbirds, buildings, and monster animations.
Version 1.0.10 (2024.10.7)

Added operation tips in the tech tree;
Fixed an issue where worker housing couldn't be built in the tutorial.
Version 1.0.9 (2024.10.7)

Optimized frame rate drops caused by having too many units in the game;
Fixed various display errors and water source issues for guest players;
Fixed performance issues that gradually worsened after 30 minutes of gameplay with a logistics warehouse;
It is now impossible to build workbird housing or soldier housing in dungeons.

Thank you all for your support! We've received a lot of feedback and suggestions, and there are currently over 60 recorded fixes and optimizations. However, due to limited manpower, we can't address all of them immediately. We'll try our best to release daily updates to resolve these issues and hope to start working on new content soon. Please continue sharing your feedback with us!

Enjoy your game, Guardians!

https://store.steampowered.com/app/2512930/_/

If you're interested in the Sanctree, follow us on social media for more content! 
Please join our Discord and report any issues you encounter in the bug report section. We will do our best to assist you and optimize your gaming experience!
